00:47:48,750 --> 00:47:54,750
Sound of My Voice is a 2011 American psychological thriller film
directed by Zal Batmanglij in his feature directorial debut.

10
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:13,500
The screenplay was written by Batmanglij and Brit Marling, and the film
stars Christopher Denham, Nicole Vicius, and Marling.

11
00:58:26,250 --> 00:58:32,250
The plot focuses on two documentary filmmakers who infiltrate a cult led
by a charismatic woman who claims to be from the future.

12
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
The film premiered at the 2011 Sundance Film Festival and was
also selected to close the 2011 SXSW Film Festival.

13
01:09:03,750 --> 01:09:09,750
It was released by Fox Searchlight Pictures on April 27, 2012.

14
01:14:22,500 --> 01:14:28,500
The film explores themes of journalist,
manipulation, hidden camera, teacher, school.

15
01:19:41,250 --> 01:19:47,250
The tone is dark and emotional and mind_bending.
